  "description": {
    "en": "Yonex PolyTour Spin is a five-sided polyester monofilament engineered for aggressive players seeking maximum spin and a solid response. Its pentagonal geometry provides strong mechanical ball bite, allowing fast swings to generate heavy rotation and higher net clearance. Compared with PolyTour Pro, it is significantly firmer and more spin-oriented; compared with PolyTour Rev, it relies more heavily on direct mechanical bite rather than SIF-enhanced snapback.",

    "zh": "Yonex PolyTour Spin 是一款采用五边形截面的聚酯单丝球线，专门面向挥拍激进、追求最大旋转的球员。Pentagonal 五边形结构通过锐利边缘直接提高球线与网球之间的 Mechanical Ball Bite，从而制造更重的 Topspin、更高的过网高度以及更明显的弹跳。相比 PolyTour Pro，它明显更硬、更偏控制和旋转；相比 PolyTour Rev，它更依赖五边形的机械咬球，而 Rev 则更多结合异形结构与 SIF 高速 Snapback 来制造旋转。"
  },

